      "change": "The prompt label moves from `v15` to `v16`, which moves the settings digest and the digests that hold it",
      "why": "#440 changed the prompt: every agent is told to stop what it started before its final reply, and a Claude Code launch gets a section on what a pending background task does. Every arm runs Claude Code on one label, so what is compared does not move, and no threshold, task or other setting changes",
