      "date": "2026-11-07",
      "change": "Two allow-list keys are added under `execution`, which moves the settings digest and the digests that hold it",
      "why": "#286 gives agent launches and repository commands an allow-list key each. `real_run_config.yaml` sets neither, so every launch of every arm gets the names it got before, and no threshold, task or other setting changes. `tests/evaluation.py` reads the repository commands' names, as the engine now does, so its copy of the validation policy stays the engine's",
      "real_runs_before": "None recorded: the protocol was registered on 2026-11-05 with none, and no record has been added since"
    }
